# What the image build must not carry into its context.
#
# The builder copies the whole context with `COPY . .`, so anything listed here
# is a file the build would read, hash and then discard. dist/ is the reason
# this file exists: a full release is eight binaries across two variants and
# some 300 MB (Story 8.8), all of it rebuilt inside the image anyway.
dist/
coverage.out

# The build takes its version, commit and date from build arguments, so it
# never reads the repository's history.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
